          "text": "One of the receptacles on the rim of a water wheel into which the water rushes, causing the wheel to revolve; also, a float of a paddle wheel.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "The valved piston of a lifting pump. Fire bucket, a bucket for carrying water to put out fires.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
